# Arolsen transport list scans: local research copies only.
# Arolsen Terms of Use sec. 7 bars passing digital copies to third
# parties / integrating them into another archive without consent,
# and the originals sit with the Austrian State Archive (see
# transports/README.md). Manifests and READMEs stay versioned.
/transports/**/*.jpg
/transports/**/*.png

